      "tier": "tooltip",
      "text": "Jarvan summons an aegis, Slowing nearby enemies by 15/20/25/30/35% for 2 seconds and granting him a (60/80/100/120/140 + (70% bonus Attack Damage)) Shield, increased by (1.3% Health) for each enemy champion hit.",
